      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55F6556A202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "牠這是怎麼了呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "72609019662F600E9EBC4E865462FF1F00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不得了啦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D5F974E865566FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有個奇怪的扭洞登場啦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6709500B5947602A7684626D6D1E767B58345566FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且從那個扭洞還一直湧出\n莫名其妙的力量。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E145F9E90A3500B626D6D1E90844E0076F46E6751FA000A83AB540D517659997684529B91CF300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "感覺不像是失控超級進化，\n但那股力量的中心讓我挺在意的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "611F89BA4E0D50CF662F593163A78D857D1A90325316FF0C000A4F4690A380A1529B91CF76844E2D5FC38B936211633A5728610F7684300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "中心？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E2D5FC3FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在意？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5728610FFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在扭洞深處……力量中心的，\n似乎是隻胡帕！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5728626D6D1E6DF1865520262026529B91CF4E2D5FC37684FF0C000A4F3C4E4E662F96BB80E15E15FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以啊，\n拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳去調查一下吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5554AFF0C000A62DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B353BB8ABF67E54E004E0B5427FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這到底是怎麼回事？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901952305E95662F600E9EBC56DE4E8BFF1F00100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這是怎麼回事？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019662F600E9EBC56DE4E8BFF1F00100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>，<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n我覺得胡帕牠會這麼害怕，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n可能是和奇怪的扭洞有關係。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002018B0001FF0C0010000201000000FF0C000A621189BA5F9780E15E157260670390199EBC5BB36015FF0C00100001BE00000A53EF80FD662F548C5947602A7684626D6D1E670995DC4FC2300200100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且，胡帕你應該也會\n在意另一隻胡帕的存在吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E14FF0C80E15E154F6061C98A724E5F6703000A5728610F53E64E0096BB80E15E1576845B5857285427300200100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗶啪！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55F6556AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "說得也是。\n就當作是安馨兒的委託來接吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8AAA5F974E5F662F3002000A5C3175764F5C662F5B8999A85152768459D48A174F8663A55427300200100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這樣的話，\n就當作是接下了安馨兒的委託吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90196A2376848A71FF0C000A5C3175764F5C662F63A54E0B4E865B8999A85152768459D48A175427300200100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對了，把剛才那個懲戒之壺一起帶去，\n感覺會比較好喔！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我的預感有大約2成是會成真的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D4E86FF0C628A525B624D90A3500B61F262124E4B58FA4E008D775E3653BBFF0C000A611F89BA67036BD48F03597D5594FF0100100001BE00000A621176849810611F670959277D0400326210662F67036210771F7684300200100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對了，剛才那個懲戒之壺，\n我覺得應該要帶去！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我的直覺有20％左右會成真喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D4E86FF0C525B624D90A3500B61F262124E4B58FAFF0C000A621189BA5F9761C98A7289815E3653BBFF0100100001BE00000A6211768476F489BA670900320030FF055DE653F367036210771F5594300200100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這麼有自信地說出那數字，有點……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90199EBC670981EA4FE157308AAA51FA90A365785B57FF0C67099EDE2026202600100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也算是為了胡帕，\n快去調查出現的那個扭洞吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F7B97662F70BA4E8680E15E15FF0C000A5FEB53BB8ABF67E551FA73FE768490A3500B626D6D1E5427FF0100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也算是為了胡帕，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳去調查出現的那個扭洞吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
