      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳眼前那傢伙\n百分之百就是胡帕！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
