    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳順利完成委託了呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B3980652295B8C621059D48A174E865462300200100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "胡帕也正在等著。\n我們這就回旅館Z吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80E15E154E5F6B6357287B4984573002000A6211501190195C3156DE65C59928005A5427FF0100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿2",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00320000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗶啪！？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 2568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55F6556AFF01FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "胡噗噗。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 2580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80E15657565730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "趁<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳去調查的時候，\n我查了關於胡帕和懲戒之壺的事。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 2592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D8100100003110000FF01014F6059B353BB8ABF67E5768466425019FF0C000A621167E54E8695DC65BC80E15E15548C61F262124E4B58FA76844E8B300200100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳進行調查的時候，\n我調查了關於胡帕和懲戒之壺的事喔！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 2664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "572800100003110000FF01014F6059B39032884C8ABF67E5768466425019FF0C000A62118ABF67E54E8695DC65BC80E15E15548C61F262124E4B58FA76844E8B5594FF0100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "懲戒之壺是在很久以前，\n把當時在四處大鬧的胡帕的力量<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n封印住的東西呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 2744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "61F262124E4B58FA662F57285F884E454EE5524DFF0C000A628A75766642572856DB865559279B27768480E15E157684529B91CF00100001BE00000A5C0153704F4F76846771897F5462300200100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "懲戒之壺是在很久以前，\n把當時在四處大鬧的胡帕的力量<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n封印住的東西喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 2832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "61F262124E4B58FA662F57285F884E454EE5524DFF0C000A628A75766642572856DB865559279B27768480E15E157684529B91CF00100001BE00000A5C0153704F4F76846771897F5594300200100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳在異次元對戰的就是\n被封印之前的胡帕……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n解放胡帕。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 2920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B3572875706B2151435C0D623076845C31662F000A88AB5C0153704E4B524D768480E15E152026202600100001BE00000A89E3653E80E15E15300200100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還有，<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳在異次元對戰的是\n被封印之前的胡帕……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n解放胡帕。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 3004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90846709FF0C00100003110000FF01014F6059B3572875706B2151435C0D62307684662F000A88AB5C0153704E4B524D768480E15E152026202600100001BE00000A89E3653E80E15E15300200100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "據說我的胡帕是\n懲戒胡帕。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 3092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "64DA8AAA6211768480E15E15662F000A61F2621280E15E15300200100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "更厲害的是\n只要用懲戒之壺，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n就能讓懲戒胡帕\n變成解放胡帕！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 3128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "66F453B25BB37684662F000A53EA8981752861F262124E4B58FAFF0C00100001BE01000A5C3180FD8B9361F2621280E15E15000A8B8A621089E3653E80E15E15FF0100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "更厲害的是\n只要用懲戒之壺，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n就能讓懲戒胡帕\n變成解放胡帕喔！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 3204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "66F453B25BB37684662F000A53EA8981752861F262124E4B58FAFF0C00100001BE01000A5C3180FD8B9361F2621280E15E15000A8B8A621089E3653E80E15E155594FF0100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過，安馨兒的胡帕\n好像不喜歡懲戒之壺，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n看來是不會變化形態。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 3284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D904EFF0C5B8999A85152768480E15E15000A597D50CF4E0D559C6B6161F262124E4B58FAFF0C00100001BE00000A770B4F86662F4E0D67038B8A53165F62614B300200100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過，安馨兒的胡帕\n好像不喜歡懲戒之壺，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n不會變化形態。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 3364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D904EFF0C5B8999A85152768480E15E15000A597D50CF4E0D559C6B6161F262124E4B58FAFF0C00100001BE00000A4E0D67038B8A53165F62614B300200100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗶啪啪！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 3436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55F6556A556AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是的！請不要讓我的胡帕\n看到懲戒之壺。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 3448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F7684FF018ACB4E0D89818B936211768480E15E15000A770B523061F262124E4B58FA300200100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但很高興透過這次的事情，\n讓我現在更了解胡帕了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 3496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F465F889AD88208900F904E90196B2176844E8B60C5FF0C000A8B93621173FE572866F44E8689E380E15E154E86300200100002011401A50000",
